<div class="form-group">
    <label class="short">Drained AP</label>
    <div class="attached-input">
        <input type="number" min="0" name="system.rules.{{index}}.drainedValue" value="{{rule.drainedValue}}" placeholder="0"/>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="form-group">
    <label class="short">Bound AP</label>
    <div class="attached-input">
        <input type="number" min="0" name="system.rules.{{index}}.boundValue" value="{{rule.boundValue}}" placeholder="0"/>
    </div>
</div>

<p class="hint">Drained AP reduces both max and current AP. Bound AP reduces only current AP (max is unchanged), and is restored when the item is deleted.</p>
